{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26997","headline":"和王郎中召看牡丹 · 姚合","name":"和王郎中召看牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"葩叠萼相重，烧栏复照空。\n妍姿朝景里，醉艳晚烟中。\n乍怪霞临砌，还疑烛出笼。\n遶行惊地赤，移坐觉衣红。\n殷丽开繁朵，香浓发几丛。\n裁绡样岂似，染茜色宁同。\n嫩畏人看损，鲜愁日炙融。\n婵娟涵宿露，烂熳抵春风。\n纵赏襟情合，闲吟景思通。\n客来归尽懒，莺恋语无穷。\n万物珍那比，千金买不充。\n如今难更有，纵有在仙宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}